// Lab 3 physical User table is exposed as RequesterUser in Prisma for one
// compatibility increment. Existing Lab 2 services/tests keep their delegate
// while the forward migration renames the physical table to User. Auth/Admin
// work in later Issues can introduce the User delegate without data changes.

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "postgresql"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

model Category {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  name      String   @unique
  isActive  Boolean  @default(true)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
  tickets   Ticket[]
}

model RequesterUser {
  id                    Int                 @id @default(autoincrement())
  name                  String              @db.VarChar(120)
  email                 String              @unique @db.VarChar(254)
  isActive              Boolean             @default(true)
  role                  UserRole            @default(REQUESTER)
  passwordHash          String?
  mustChangePassword    Boolean             @default(true)
  passwordChangedAt     DateTime?
  version               Int                 @default(1)
  createdAt             DateTime            @default(now())
  updatedAt             DateTime            @updatedAt
  tickets               Ticket[]            @relation("TicketRequester")
  ownedTickets          Ticket[]            @relation("TicketOwner")
  requesterResolved     Ticket[]            @relation("RequesterResolvedBy")
  removedAttachments    Attachment[]        @relation("AttachmentRemovedBy")
  sessions              Session[]
  publicComments        PublicComment[]
  internalNotes         InternalNote[]
  ownerChangesPrevious  TicketOwnerChange[] @relation("OwnerChangePrevious")
  ownerChangesNext      TicketOwnerChange[] @relation("OwnerChangeNext")
  ownerChangesActor     TicketOwnerChange[] @relation("OwnerChangeActor")
  performedActions      ActionTaken[]       @relation("ActionPerformedBy")
  assignedActions       ActionTaken[]       @relation("ActionAssignee")
  actionEventsActor     ActionTakenEvent[]  @relation("ActionEventActor")
  actionEventsPrevOwner ActionTakenEvent[]  @relation("ActionEventPreviousAssignee")
  actionEventsNextOwner ActionTakenEvent[]  @relation("ActionEventNextAssignee")

  @@index([role, isActive])
  @@map("User")
}

model Session {
  id         String        @id @default(uuid()) @db.Uuid
  tokenHash  String        @unique @db.Char(64)
  userId     Int
  csrfToken  String        @db.Char(64)
  createdAt  DateTime      @default(now())
  lastSeenAt DateTime      @default(now())
  expiresAt  DateTime
  user       RequesterUser @relation(fields: [userId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)

  @@index([userId, expiresAt])
}

model RelatedSystem {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  name      String   @unique @db.VarChar(120)
  isActive  Boolean  @default(true)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt
  tickets   Ticket[]
}

model Ticket {
  id                    Int               @id @default(autoincrement())
  ticketNumber          String            @unique @db.VarChar(32)
  requesterId           Int
  categoryId            Int
  relatedSystemId       Int
  ticketOwnerId         Int?
  summary               String            @db.VarChar(120)
  description           String
  requestedPriority     RequestedPriority @default(MEDIUM)
  itPriority            RequestedPriority @default(MEDIUM)
  currentStatus         TicketStatus      @default(NEW)
  version               Int               @default(1)
  workflowCycle         Int               @default(1)
  resolutionSummary     String?           @db.VarChar(2000)
  resolvedAt            DateTime?
  closedAt              DateTime?
  requesterResolvedAt   DateTime?
  requesterResolvedById Int?
  lastStatusReason      String?           @db.VarChar(250)
  clientRequestId       String            @db.Uuid
  requestPayloadHash    String            @db.Char(64)
  createdAt             DateTime          @default(now())
  updatedAt             DateTime          @updatedAt

  requester         RequesterUser       @relation("TicketRequester", fields: [requesterId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  owner             RequesterUser?      @relation("TicketOwner", fields: [ticketOwnerId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  requesterResolved RequesterUser?      @relation("RequesterResolvedBy", fields: [requesterResolvedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  category          Category            @relation(fields: [categoryId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  relatedSystem     RelatedSystem       @relation(fields: [relatedSystemId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  attachments       Attachment[]
  publicComments    PublicComment[]
  internalNotes     InternalNote[]
  ownerChanges      TicketOwnerChange[]
  actionsTaken      ActionTaken[]

  @@unique([requesterId, clientRequestId])
  @@index([requesterId, updatedAt, id])
  @@index([requesterId, categoryId])
  @@index([requesterId, relatedSystemId])
  @@index([requesterId, requestedPriority])
  @@index([requesterId, currentStatus])
  @@index([ticketOwnerId, updatedAt, id])
  @@index([currentStatus, itPriority, updatedAt, id])
  @@index([requesterResolvedById])
}

model ActionTaken {
  id                 Int               @id @default(autoincrement())
  ticketId           Int
  workflowCycle      Int               @default(1)
  performedById      Int
  assigneeId         Int?
  description        String            @db.VarChar(2000)
  result             String?           @db.VarChar(2000)
  followUpRequired   Boolean           @default(false)
  followUpNote       String?           @db.VarChar(1000)
  attachmentNotes    String?           @db.VarChar(1000)
  status             ActionTakenStatus @default(PENDING)
  clientRequestId    String            @db.Uuid
  requestPayloadHash String            @db.Char(64)
  version            Int               @default(1)
  createdAt          DateTime          @default(now())
  updatedAt          DateTime          @updatedAt

  ticket      Ticket             @relation(fields: [ticketId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  performedBy RequesterUser      @relation("ActionPerformedBy", fields: [performedById], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  assignee    RequesterUser?     @relation("ActionAssignee", fields: [assigneeId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  events      ActionTakenEvent[]

  @@unique([ticketId, clientRequestId])
  @@index([ticketId, workflowCycle, createdAt, id])
  @@index([assigneeId, status, updatedAt, id])
  @@index([performedById, updatedAt, id])
}

model ActionTakenEvent {
  id                 Int                  @id @default(autoincrement())
  actionId           Int
  actorId            Int
  eventType          ActionTakenEventType
  resultingVersion   Int
  changedFields      Json
  fromStatus         ActionTakenStatus?
  toStatus           ActionTakenStatus?
  previousAssigneeId Int?
  nextAssigneeId     Int?
  createdAt          DateTime             @default(now())

  action           ActionTaken    @relation(fields: [actionId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  actor            RequesterUser  @relation("ActionEventActor", fields: [actorId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  previousAssignee RequesterUser? @relation("ActionEventPreviousAssignee", fields: [previousAssigneeId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  nextAssignee     RequesterUser? @relation("ActionEventNextAssignee", fields: [nextAssigneeId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@unique([actionId, resultingVersion])
  @@index([actionId, createdAt, id])
  @@index([actorId, createdAt, id])
}

model Attachment {
  id                   Int       @id @default(autoincrement())
  ticketId             Int
  originalName         String    @db.VarChar(255)
  storageKey           String    @unique @db.Uuid
  mimeType             String    @db.VarChar(100)
  sizeBytes            Int
  uploadedAt           DateTime  @default(now())
  removedAt            DateTime?
  removedReason        String?   @db.VarChar(250)
  removedByRequesterId Int?

  ticket             Ticket         @relation(fields: [ticketId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  removedByRequester RequesterUser? @relation("AttachmentRemovedBy", fields: [removedByRequesterId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@index([ticketId, uploadedAt, id])
  @@index([removedByRequesterId])
}

model TicketOwnerChange {
  id              Int                     @id @default(autoincrement())
  ticketId        Int
  previousOwnerId Int?
  nextOwnerId     Int?
  actorId         Int
  changedAt       DateTime                @default(now())
  reason          TicketOwnerChangeReason

  ticket        Ticket         @relation(fields: [ticketId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  previousOwner RequesterUser? @relation("OwnerChangePrevious", fields: [previousOwnerId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  nextOwner     RequesterUser? @relation("OwnerChangeNext", fields: [nextOwnerId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)
  actor         RequesterUser  @relation("OwnerChangeActor", fields: [actorId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@index([ticketId, changedAt, id])
  @@index([previousOwnerId])
  @@index([nextOwnerId])
}

model PublicComment {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  ticketId  Int
  authorId  Int
  content   String   @db.VarChar(5000)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  ticket Ticket        @relation(fields: [ticketId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  author RequesterUser @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@index([ticketId, createdAt, id])
  @@index([authorId])
}

model InternalNote {
  id        Int      @id @default(autoincrement())
  ticketId  Int
  authorId  Int
  content   String   @db.VarChar(5000)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())

  ticket Ticket        @relation(fields: [ticketId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  author RequesterUser @relation(fields: [authorId], references: [id], onDelete: Restrict)

  @@index([ticketId, createdAt, id])
  @@index([authorId])
}

enum UserRole {
  REQUESTER
  IT_STAFF
  ADMINISTRATOR
}

enum RequestedPriority {
  LOW
  MEDIUM
  HIGH
  URGENT
}

enum TicketStatus {
  NEW
  OPEN
  IN_PROGRESS
  WAITING_FOR_REQUESTER
  RESOLVED
  CLOSED
  REOPENED
  CANCELLED
}

enum TicketOwnerChangeReason {
  ASSIGNED
  REASSIGNED
  ACCOUNT_INELIGIBLE
}

enum ActionTakenStatus {
  PENDING
  IN_PROGRESS
  COMPLETED
  CANCELLED
}

enum ActionTakenEventType {
  CREATED
  UPDATED
  ASSIGNED
  STATUS_CHANGED
}
